      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Welcome to the house."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Viktor",
      "text": "The lights are dim. [greeting]?"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-003",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Dmitri",
      "text": "The fire is low, but the room is warm."
    },
    {
      "id": "clip-004",
      "type": "video",
      "file": "media/f3/f3f95674ec5ca4acac14de72647a1e926e99f11f852633d46e1b9073a8fd4e3f.mp4",
      "poster": "media/78/78417a2f84fc75e63ee5c5652fe4fd4769e6a5b7e052b1ee04e00b9fed105b96.jxl",
      "durationSeconds": 1.0,
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "The screen flickers to life."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-005",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Dmitri",
      "text": "Тени танцуют на стене."
    },
    {
      "id": "bg-yard-006",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/d2/d20230e78d6ef5fc7c196b9a2b29c126dc0567e474a7b621c9a001b83cc1b44e.jxl",
      "text": "Тишина в саду. [wind]"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-007",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Гостья",
      "text": "It almost feels like home."
    },
    {
      "id": "bg-room-008",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/4e/4e31ed53f4e9c99c989189f6b0bcda70e59e3f22b3b16151cc53db95142f882e.jxl",
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "The fire crackles as the room warms."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-009",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Dmitri",
      "text": "Tea, then. The strong kind."
    },
    {
      "id": "bg-yard-010",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/d2/d20230e78d6ef5fc7c196b9a2b29c126dc0567e474a7b621c9a001b83cc1b44e.jxl",
      "speaker": "Гостья",
      "text": "The gravel sounds louder at night."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Somewhere past the hedge, water runs."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The night settles over the house."
    },
    {
      "id": "bg-room-013",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/4e/4e31ed53f4e9c99c989189f6b0bcda70e59e3f22b3b16151cc53db95142f882e.jxl",
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Back inside, where it is quiet."
    },
    {
      "id": "line-014",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "Dmitri",
      "text": "Good night."
    },
    {
      "id": "mislabel-bmp-015",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/76/766061c78f173b2148c2b73008b3807be584b2c7d3303271a74e6dd6fb05ebff.jxl",
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "A small painting on the wall."
    },
    {
      "id": "mislabel-png-016",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/a0/a036d597c7e05081cefdce07aae1b742b412828d1a057122550198beebed306c.jxl",
      "text": "The frame beside it hides its true format too."
    },
    {
      "id": "bg-reprise-017",
      "type": "image",
      "file": "media/4e/4e31ed53f4e9c99c989189f6b0bcda70e59e3f22b3b16151cc53db95142f882e.jxl",
      "speaker": "Dmitri",
      "text": "The same room again, seen from the hall."
    },
    {
      "id": "photo-noise-018",
